# Benchmark window "first scene" (PLAN_LOWS M3). Starts when the first scene's first 3D frame is in (state first_scene: New Game, the intro
# movie cut short). No input: the intro's cutscene runs by itself at the configured (real-time) step; the window is 170 s of it, the log
# lines "bench: first_scene start" / "bench: first_scene end" (tools/perf/bench_window.py --first-scene).
@rate 0
@log bench: first_scene start
@sleep 170000
@log bench: first_scene end